{
  "_readme": [
    "Credibility bar and inline logo marks. A logo renders only when it has a file and `permission` is `approved`.",
    "To add a logo: place a file in src/assets/logos/ and set `file` plus `permission`. Entries without a file render as a text wordmark in the same slot, so a later logo swap does not reflow the band.",
    "`relationship` is shown as a small caption so no organization is mislabeled as a client. Order here is display order.",
    "`optical` (optional) sizes a logo by eye for the bar, for a mark whose drawing sits differently in its frame from its neighbors': `scale` multiplies the bar's logo height and `shift` moves it by that fraction of the height (negative is up). The file itself is never altered."
  ],
